 enhancing guest satisfaction. Are you ready to turn your hotel into a luxurious getaway and build the business of your dreams? The journey to becoming a hotel tycoon starts here!", "short_description": "Step into the world of hotel management with Dream Hotel VR! Hire staff, upgrade rooms, and expand your dream hotel to become the ultimate hospitality tycoon."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Totos Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tolgakalaycioglu.com/totosgame/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "29402786019324849"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391749_1124445296136347_3347418758256101320_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_WHeDZ1oLLoQ7kNvwF9bA7o&_nc_oc=AdoYhh3_0ATJhb2ld18axlQ_hsFswPaO7ImIM6k0kW_9GZpGDK3-rBs52Xx-56783SA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPN9yk0WilY2yzBrKGFT7NpJQpFDK0QSlmXZAKMnZuyTw&oe=6ACE424F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Dream Hotel", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {